   N = 32, the smallest ||A|| (960): 1.2e-06 at m <= 0.2, 1.04e-05 up to m = 14.1, 2.4e-05 at m = 72, 3.2e-05 at m = 132
   N = 32, the largest ||A|| (1112): 1.3e-06 at m <= 0.2, 1.04e-05 up to m = 12.2, 2.5e-05 at m = 72, 3.4e-05 at m = 132
   N = 40, the smallest ||A|| (1537): 1.6e-06 at m <= 0.2, 1.04e-05 up to m = 8.8, 3.0e-05 at m = 72, 4.0e-05 at m = 132
   N = 40, the largest ||A|| (1734): 1.7e-06 at m <= 0.2, 1.04e-05 up to m = 7.8, 3.2e-05 at m = 72, 4.3e-05 at m = 132
